{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00111",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 3.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Morning. Just put your bag down anywhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.43,
      "end_seconds": 7.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.35,
      "end_seconds": 10.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.51,
      "end_seconds": 19.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling cold all the time, doctor. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.13,
      "end_seconds": 22.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Right, have you had dry skin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.11,
      "end_seconds": 28.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, nearly five years. About dry skin, it's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.21,
      "end_seconds": 32.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Have you had any palpitations, heavy periods or trouble swallowing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.67,
      "end_seconds": 38.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Well, I haven't had palpitations, heavy periods or trouble swallowing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.34,
      "end_seconds": 43.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Any hair loss or low mood at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.92,
      "end_seconds": 46.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.5,
      "end_seconds": 50.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.19,
      "end_seconds": 55.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "So, uh, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.95,
      "end_seconds": 60.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.35,
      "end_seconds": 80.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Okay, continuing. Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.65,
      "end_seconds": 83.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Right, my mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.04,
      "end_seconds": 87.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "So, any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.47,
      "end_seconds": 93.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, I'm allergic to eggs, I get stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.6,
      "end_seconds": 98.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.06,
      "end_seconds": 110.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.91,
      "end_seconds": 115.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.14,
      "end_seconds": 133.13,
      "duration_seconds": 16.99,
      "text": "Iron tablets, once a day for my blood count. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I take metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day. I'm on aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.53,
      "end_seconds": 136.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.68,
      "end_seconds": 149.89,
      "duration_seconds": 12.21,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.98,
      "end_seconds": 154.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.22,
      "end_seconds": 167.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.24,
      "text": "I've had low haemoglobin, yes. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I've got diabetes. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.18,
      "end_seconds": 168.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Mm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.56,
      "end_seconds": 175.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.65,
      "end_seconds": 177.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.75,
      "end_seconds": 183.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "I had a stent put in my heart two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 184.74,
      "end_seconds": 196.94,
      "duration_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 14, SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse 84, height 175 centimetres, weight 55 kilos, blood pressure 110 over 71, temp 36.7 degrees, BMI works out to 18.0."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.32,
      "end_seconds": 198.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.37,
      "end_seconds": 202.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.47,
      "end_seconds": 203.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.19,
      "end_seconds": 205.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.42,
      "end_seconds": 220.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Reflexes are a bit slow to relax."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.34,
      "end_seconds": 222.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.72,
      "end_seconds": 226.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.53,
      "end_seconds": 238.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Your pulse is slow, about fifty-six, and the thyroid isn't enlarged."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.87,
      "end_seconds": 267.16,
      "duration_seconds": 26.29,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like an underactive thyroid. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling cold all the time, and no trouble swallowing or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.42,
      "end_seconds": 269.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.15,
      "end_seconds": 274.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.26,
      "end_seconds": 275.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.41,
      "end_seconds": 295.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for hypothyroid symptoms. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.51,
      "end_seconds": 297.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.67,
      "end_seconds": 313.81,
      "duration_seconds": 15.14,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for fatigue. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Let's use levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach, until we review. It's for hypothyroidism."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.38,
      "end_seconds": 316.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.32,
      "end_seconds": 338.25,
      "duration_seconds": 19.93,
      "text": "Take the thyroid tablet on an empty stomach, half an hour before breakfast, and not with calcium or iron. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.21,
      "end_seconds": 341.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Got it, um, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.25,
      "end_seconds": 345.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.57,
      "end_seconds": 347.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.63,
      "end_seconds": 353.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.4,
      "end_seconds": 362.71,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "So, I take the levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach and come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.09,
      "end_seconds": 367.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.68,
      "end_seconds": 373.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.51,
      "end_seconds": 375.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}